  "html": "<h3>Meet Our Experienced Family Law Team</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our team of experienced family lawyers understand that the only winners in long, drawn out court battles are lawyers.</p>\n<p>Instead, we strive on your behalf to find mutually acceptable agreements with both parties before matters proceed to court. This can help you achieve a reasonable outcome in a professional and effective manner.</p>\n<p>The idea of a “bulldog lawyer fighting for you” is outdated. </p>\n<p>An aggressive, combative approach can result in a lengthy and expensive process that is damaging for all parties.</p>\n<p>Instead we focus on being open and communicative to create an amicable and equitable outcome for you and your dependants – while remaining highly capable in confidently championing your rights.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/N163-310linkedin.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Tash Nolan - Director</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/N163-003linkedin.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Chad Zarif - Practice Manager</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/N192-0010-linkedin.jpg\" alt=\"Family Law Melbourne - divorce specialist\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Anastasia Simes - Partner</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/N214-107-LinkedIn-v2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Sandra Banjamin - Partner - Accredited Specialist</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/N185-070-linkedin.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Jessica Swain - Partner</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"route:profile:christopher-kissoglou\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/N208-07-LinkedIn.jpg\" alt=\"Nolan Family Law Sydney - Christopher Kissoglou\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Christopher Kissoglou - Senior Associate - Accredited Specialist </figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/N203-016-LinkedIn-v2.jpg\" alt=\"Doyles Awarded - Nolan Family Law &amp; Mediation Sydney - Meet the team\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Toby Henson - Senior Paralegal</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/N191-0103-linkedin.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Amy Sultana - Senior Paralegal</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/N217-064-LinkedIn.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"450\" height=\"450\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption>Thomas Hughes - Paralegal</figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Discuss your family law needs<br>with our dedicated team</p>"
